    answer: 'Onboarding runs 3 days (Starter) to 14 days (Enterprise). Industry typical is 2 to 4 weeks. Our AI research layer starts mapping your market the hour you sign.'
  - question: 'Can I start with one service?'
    answer: 'Yes. A la carte pricing is published for every line. Start with the service that moves the needle fastest, then scale when the numbers justify it.'
